<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - GCC started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GCC started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caspian Securities said on Friday it has started coverage of Mexican cement company Grupo Cementos de Chihuahua SA de CV with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Our 12-month price target is 12.28 pesos per share, representing a nominal peso return of 44 percent and a U.S. dollar return of 26 percent,&quot; analysts Paul A. Rodriguez and Sebastien Chatel said in a report.</p>
<p>((--Daniel Perez, Monterrey bureau, +528 345-7617))</p>
</text>
